は可能ですか？\n\n両方のOCが作品に入っていることを確認してください\n両OCの参考リンク: https://imgur.com/a/ssDoXfs\n\n大崎は22歳の外向的な女の子で、ライトグリーンの瞳にピンクと白の髪をしています。\n身長165cm、バストはDサイズで、スリムな体型です。\n\nユキは21歳の内気な女の子で、大崎の親友です。薄紫色の瞳、紫のハイライトが入った明るい茶色の髪。\n身長は160cm、バストはCサイズ、体型はスリムです。\n\nよろしくお願いします。", "nc": 1, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}], "similar_creators": [{"id": 38515, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "ろこ🐿🍀", "screen_name": "roko_pallet", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1674561478027018241/Tdnt2SHU.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/870625248567115776/1688081508/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}], "nc": 1}, {"id": 636864, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": false, "acceptable": true, "name": "いぬい🍋イラスト＆Live2D依頼受付中", "screen_name": "inui16g", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1799275973713756160/o907Gs90.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1226537248004304896/1607101919/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 30, "skills": [{"genre": "art"}, {"genre": "video"}], "nc": 48}, {"id": 1068592, "creator": true, "nsfw_acceptable": true, "acceptable": true, "name": "364ing(多忙)", "screen_name": "364ing01", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1887917803405238272/cID8bDBv.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1363152561675493383/1632964948/1500x500", "appeal_receivable": false, "popular_creator_rank": null, "request_master_rank": null, "first_requester_rank": null, "deleted_at": null, "tip_acceptable_by": "all", "accept_expiration_days": 3, "skills": [{"genre": "art